    "26": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Ecco, l'ho detto! <C:0000,0002,6400>Ora possiamo\navere l'<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Uovo onirico<C:0000,0003,000000FF>?<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Ecco, l'ho detto! <C:0000,0002,6400>Ora possiamo\navere l'<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Uovo onirico<C:0000,0003,000000FF>?<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Ecco, l'ho detto! <C:0000,0002,6400>Ora possiamo\navere l'<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Uovo onirico<C:0000,0003,000000FF>?<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Ecco, l'ho detto! <C:0000,0002,6400>Ora possiamo\navere l'<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Uovo onirico<C:0000,0003,000000FF>?<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "27": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Non sono sicura che tu fossi sincero,\nma l'entusiasmo ce lo hai messo...<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Non sono sicura che tu fossi sincero,\nma l'entusiasmo ce lo hai messo...<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Non sono sicura che tu fossi sincero,\nma l'entusiasmo ce lo hai messo...<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Non sono sicura che tu fossi sincero,\nma l'entusiasmo ce lo hai messo...<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "28": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>E va bene! Ecco\nil vostro uovo!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>E va bene! Ecco\nil vostro uovo!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
